WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:05,530
The plane is grounded and we can only drive, I remember

2
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:07,490
You don't seem to be from the same place

3
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:12,150
Isn’t it just that there is no work at all?

4
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:13,870
We're getting ready to go out and have some fun

5
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,190
It's a coincidence

6
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,020
I want to say something next

7
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,140
Don't be upset and don't get excited.

8
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,340
Especially Xiaosu

9
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:26,780
Forget it, Xiaofan

10
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,380
You cover Xiaosu’s mouth

11
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,860
Also prepare yourself mentally

12
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,160
Don't look back

13
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,160
The family of four behind the big boss

14
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,280
I can’t tell if they are all infected.

15
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,040
The younger son has become lost

16
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:45,590
They used to be little neighbors. What evidence is there? Look at their fingers.

17
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:47,540
Nails slightly clear

18
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:50,990
The parents and the eldest son both wore makeup but on their necks

19
00:00:51,270 --> 00:01:09,480
I can still see clear spots. Thank you for reminding me when necessary.

20
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,000
You can take refuge here with me
